		<personalityDescription>Esther believes that hesitation is just another way to lose. She trusts her instincts, makes the call, and commits fully - because in her mind, the worst decision is no decision at all. Esther doesn&apos;t wait for opportunity - she creates it. Whether it&apos;s training, strategizing, or climbing the ranks, she throws herself into every task with relentless determination, always pushing toward her next goal. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Trusts instincts over perfection. Believes any action is better than none.&lt;br&gt;- Makes their own opportunities. Relentless pursuit of the next goal.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
