		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>People are just pieces on a board to Burgondo. She lies, twists the truth, and pulls strings from the shadows, bending others to her will without them ever knowing. If someone thinks they&apos;re in control, it&apos;s only because Burgondo wants them to think that. Burgondo doesn&apos;t believe in brute force when superior strategy will do. She dissects enemy formations, anticipates movements, and executes plans with ruthless efficiency - ensuring that by the time the battle begins, she&apos;s already won. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Lies, twists, and pulls strings unseen. Lets others believe they&apos;re in charge.&lt;br&gt;- Strategy-first operator - kills with planning, not firepower.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
