		<personalityDescription>Sezer acts first and deals with the consequences later. He thrives on instinct, making split-second decisions with unshakable confidence - sometimes brilliant, sometimes reckless, but always decisive. Sezer will absolutely fight in whatever conditions he has to, but that doesn&apos;t mean he won&apos;t voice his disappointment the entire time. Whether it&apos;s loadout choices, terrain, or enemy tactics, he has opinions. &quot;You call this a firing position? No cover, bad angles, and don&apos;t get me started on the damn wind.&quot; </personalityDescription>
