		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>People trust Glikeriya because she&apos;s real. She doesn&apos;t fake emotions, doesn&apos;t manipulate, and doesn&apos;t care about putting on an act. Her honesty may be blunt at times, but it makes her both respected and reliable. Glikeriya doesn&apos;t believe in safe moments. If things are too quiet, if an operation is going smoothly, she starts getting worse, not better. &quot;Something&apos;s wrong. It&apos;s too easy. Too clean. There&apos;s always something waiting.&quot; </personalityDescription>
