		<personalityDescription>Marvin locks onto their objectives with laser precision. Distractions, doubts, and setbacks don&apos;t faze them - once they set their sights on something, they follow through until the job is done. Marvin is the spark that ignites every situation. Their charisma, ambition, and relentless drive make them impossible to ignore, drawing people in and pushing events forward with sheer force of will. </personalityDescription>
