		<personalityDescription>Haico sees morality as a luxury he can&apos;t afford. If there&apos;s a faster, more efficient way to get ahead - no matter how brutal - he&apos;ll take it without hesitation or regret. Haico has a rare gift: the ability to make others feel seen. Whether with a few words, a knowing glance, or simply his presence, he reminds people that they are not alone in their struggles. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Brutality is a shortcut - and they never hesitate to take it.&lt;br&gt;- Makes people feel seen. That alone can turn a losing fight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
