		<personalityDescription>Takiji doesn&apos;t believe in delegation, compromise, or second opinions. If something needs to be done, he&apos;ll do it his way - whether anyone asked for his help or not. Takiji never shuts up. He&apos;s talking tactics, reliving old fights, or just going on about something unrelated mid-skirmish. &quot;You ever wonder if our DropShips are just really expensive coffins? No? Just me? Cool.&quot; </personalityDescription>
