		<personalityDescription>Sui-Gee doesn&apos;t just look down on others - she barely acknowledges them. She sees herself as superior in every way, treating allies as tools and enemies as annoyances. If someone disagrees with her, it&apos;s because they&apos;re too stupid to understand why she&apos;s right. Sui-Gee fights for one thing: the highest bidder. She&apos;s not interested in honor, loyalty, or causes - just cold, hard cash and a contract that keeps her alive and well-paid. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Barely acknowledges teammates. Sees people as tools or distractions.&lt;br&gt;- Hired gun. No cause, no loyalty - just money.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
