		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>Mike has never met a fight he didn&apos;t want to start - or finish. Whether it&apos;s charging headfirst into battle or arguing over who gets the last drink, he runs on impulse, always running hot and never cooling down. Compassion is a weakness Mike can&apos;t afford. He doesn&apos;t hesitate to make hard decisions, sacrifice allies, or eliminate threats with cold efficiency. In his mind, survival means shutting out anything that might make him hesitate. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Runs on impulse. Seeks out fights, never backs off. No cooldown.&lt;br&gt;- Cuts ties as easily as throats - doesn&apos;t blink.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
