		<personalityDescription>Latrice doesn&apos;t just enjoy passion - she commands it. With a confident smirk and an irresistible charm, she draws others into her orbit, knowing exactly how to fuel the fire of desire and leave them wanting more. Latrice jokes, grins, and cracks a smirk even when things are falling apart. &quot;Latrice, we&apos;re pinned down.&quot; Smile. &quot;Latrice, command just abandoned us.&quot; Grin. &quot;Latrice, what the hell is so funny?&quot; &quot;Nothing,&quot; she says, still smiling. &quot;What else can we do?&quot; </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Draws people in, burns hot, moves on. Makes allies - or mistakes - fast.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
