		<personalityDescription>Claas&apos;s expertise isn&apos;t just learned - it&apos;s ingrained. Whether adapting to new challenges or refining old skills, he performs with a level of competence that leaves others struggling to keep up. No matter how hardened the universe tries to make him, Claas refuses to shut himself off from others. He carries their burdens as if they were his own, always willing to stand beside those who feel lost or alone. </personalityDescription>
