		<personalityDescription>Patience and restraint have never been Clarissa&apos;s strengths. She acts first, thinks later, and rarely regrets it - because in her mind, slowing down is just another way of losing. Clarissa stretches because it&apos;s something to control. Muscles loosen, joints adjust, everything works the way it&apos;s supposed to. Unlike her past mistakes. Unlike the ghosts she keeps running from. Her body has to be ready - because if it ever locks up, so will she. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Acts fast, rarely looks back. Believes slowing down equals failure.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
