		<personalityDescription>Finlay acts on instinct, rarely stopping to consider the consequences before charging ahead. Whether on the battlefield or in conversation, he prefers action over hesitation - sometimes to his own detriment. Finlay is never on time, but somehow, he always shows up just when things are about to go south. Whether it&apos;s rolling onto the battlefield in a hail of fire, dropping into the fray seconds before an ambush, or sprinting to his post as the DropShip doors open, he&apos;s living proof that &quot;better late than never&quot; sometimes does work. </personalityDescription>
