		<personalityDescription>Calandra approaches every fight with precision, analyzing the battlefield and making calculated moves. She doesn&apos;t waste effort on flashy maneuvers - every action serves a purpose, every shot is deliberate. Calandra doesn&apos;t just lead - she elevates those around her. Whether it&apos;s a rousing speech before battle, a quiet word of encouragement, or leading by example, she makes people feel like they can accomplish the impossible. </personalityDescription>
