		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>Amy refuses to let hardship define her. She&apos;s weathered every storm life has thrown at her, adapting, enduring, and proving that no amount of pain or pressure can break her will. War is messy. Orders change. People die. But manuals? Manuals are structured, predictable, reliable. Amy reads them obsessively because they offer certainty - cold, clinical instructions that don&apos;t lie, don&apos;t panic, and don&apos;t get killed when things go wrong. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Refuses to be defined by pain. Endures, adapts, overcomes.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
