		<personalityDescription>Martin carries a permanent chip on their shoulder, always ready to turn a disagreement into a full-blown confrontation. It doesn&apos;t matter if it&apos;s words or fists - what matters is proving they won. Martin has a natural gift for getting people to listen without feeling pressured. They can steer conversations, soften harsh truths, and get their way without anyone realizing they&apos;ve been guided exactly where they want them to go. </personalityDescription>
