		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>Katharina charges into danger without a second thought, unshaken by enemy fire or overwhelming odds. She believes fear is a distraction and meets every challenge with unwavering resolve. Katharina has walked away from engagements because the omens were wrong. If the sun rises through heavy fog, if the wind shifts in a way that feels unnatural, if she dreams of something she&apos;d rather forget - she&apos;ll find a way to stall, adjust, or avoid the fight entirely. People call her superstitious. She calls them reckless. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Charges in without hesitation. Treats fear as noise, not warning.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
