		<personalityDescription>Mahfuze doesn&apos;t waste time on fair deals when an unfair one gets her more. She plays on desperation, weaknesses, and ambition, twisting every situation to ensure that, in the end, Mahfuze is the one who profits most. Mahfuze doesn&apos;t need recognition - she just wants her people to succeed. Whether in battle, in planning, or in moments of doubt, she offers steady, unwavering support that reminds others they&apos;re never truly alone. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 43%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- If theres a win to be had, they&apos;ll take the lion&apos;s share and call it fair.&lt;br&gt;- Not in it for glory. Just wants the team to make it home.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
