		<personalityDescription>Kusumo doesn&apos;t argue - he disregards. He has no patience for hesitation, doubt, or anything he perceives as weakness. If someone can&apos;t keep up, he simply moves forward without them. Kusumo never lets the chaos of battle stop him from throwing in a well-timed flirt. Explosions in the background? Enemy fire raining down? He&apos;s still casually complimenting someone&apos;s voice over the comms. &quot;You know, if we survive this, you owe me dinner for saving your ass just now.&quot; </personalityDescription>
