		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>No obstacle is too great, no challenge too daunting - Debra finds a way. When others falter, she digs deep and keeps going, turning setbacks into fuel for an unstoppable drive toward victory. Tactical formations, famous last stands, the lineage of a particular unit - she can recall all of it. One moment she&apos;s breaking down the enemy&apos;s battle doctrine, the next she&apos;s casually mentioning that their insignia has roots in some obscure rebellion from 2434. Most of her comrades don&apos;t mind - unless they&apos;re trying to focus on not dying. </personalityDescription>
