		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>Deborah fights for one thing: the highest bidder. She&apos;s not interested in honor, loyalty, or causes - just cold, hard cash and a contract that keeps her alive and well-paid. Deborah keeps trophies not out of pride, but because if she doesn&apos;t, what was it all for? Every token, every relic is a reminder that she survived, that her actions meant something. Without them, everything she&apos;s done might as well be forgotten. And that&apos;s something she refuses to let happen. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Hired gun. No cause, no loyalty - just money.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
