		<personalityDescription>Niko always has a target in mind, and he won&apos;t stop until he reaches it. Every move he makes is another step toward his objective, and he doesn&apos;t waste time on anything that doesn&apos;t get him closer to success. Niko&apos;s has extra rations, fuel reserves, emergency power cells, and a dozen weapons that aren&apos;t standard issue. He doesn&apos;t just fight battles - he prepares to outlast wars. &quot;You rely on logistics. I rely on myself.&quot; </personalityDescription>
