		<personalityDescription>Some people seek compromise - Rachelle seeks conflict. She thrives on tension, turning every conversation into a challenge and every challenge into a personal battle. If there&apos;s a peaceful solution, she&apos;s not interested. Rachelle always has a smug remark loaded, making it painfully clear she thinks she&apos;s the smartest person in the room. Whether through subtle jabs or outright mockery, she has a way of making others feel small without ever raising her voice. </personalityDescription>
