		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>Anpush believes the best defense is an overwhelming offense, always pushing forward and keeping up the pressure. Hesitation is weakness, and he refuses to give his opponents a chance to recover. Anpush&apos;s greatest weapon isn&apos;t a gun - it&apos;s his ability to manipulate. He spins lies effortlessly, plants doubts where needed, and ensures that by the time the truth comes out, he&apos;s already taken what he wanted. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Believes in pressure. Always attacking. No room for defensive fallback.&lt;br&gt;- Lies like breathing. By the time truth lands, they&apos;re long gone and richer.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
