		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>There is no &quot;enough&quot; for Giolla. She grind forward, unyielding, sacrificing sleep, comfort, and even allies if necessary. Failure isn&apos;t an option - because if she stops moving, she might have to face what she&apos;s lost along the way. Giolla didn&apos;t get this far by being naive. She&apos;s seen every trick, survived every scam, and learned how to play the game better than most. She trusts no one, always keeps an edge, and makes sure she&apos;s the one doing the exploiting - not the other way around. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sacrifices everything for progress. Keeps moving to outrun whats behind.&lt;br&gt;- Not fooled easily. Seen the worst, and learned to profit from it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
