		<personalityDescription>To Kafi, restraint is a foreign concept. They surround themself with luxury, excitement, and temptation, always seeking the next thrill to satisfy their endless cravings - no matter the cost. Kafi believes in results, not feelings. They dismisse emotions as distractions and refuse to waste time comforting others. To them, facts, logic, and action matter - sympathy does not. </personalityDescription>
