		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>Moire wears her confidence like a badge of honor, parading her victories with flair and dismissing setbacks as temporary blips. Her unwavering belief in her own prowess often blinds her to potential dangers, even as she dazzles onlookers with her bold, if misguided, bravado. Moire has a talent for convincing others to do the hard work while she reaps the rewards. She plays on emotions, dangles promises just out of reach, and always manages to walk away with more than she put in. If someone ends up shortchanged, that&apos;s their problem. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 43%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Flaunts wins, shrugs off losses. Blind spots hidden behind bravado.&lt;br&gt;- Lets others do the work, then pockets the rewards with a smile.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
