		<personalityDescription>Patience and restraint have never been Ebolt&apos;s strengths. He acts first, thinks later, and rarely regrets it - because in his mind, slowing down is just another way of losing. Ebolt says what he means and means what he says. He doesn&apos;t believe in playing games or sugarcoating the truth - his words and actions come from a place of honesty, making him a rare presence in a world full of deception. </personalityDescription>
