		<personalityDescription>Bruce enjoys the finer pleasures in life and pursues them with enthusiasm. Whether it&apos;s romance, excitement, or indulgence, they see no reason to deny themself what they desire. Bruce rarely takes others seriously, rolling their eyes at concerns they don&apos;t find valid. Whether it&apos;s a risky plan, a personal grievance, or a suggestion they think is dumb, they shut it down with a snide remark and move on. </personalityDescription>
