		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>Chezzle charges into danger without a second thought, unshaken by enemy fire or overwhelming odds. She believes fear is a distraction and meets every challenge with unwavering resolve. &quot;&apos;Meks can take a beating. So can pistols. So can this.&quot; Chezzle yanks a jammed sidearm free with enough force to nearly break the slide, wrenches a stuck panel open with her bare hands, and shoves a power cell into place like she&apos;s punching it into submission. Her squad has learned to hand her the spares. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Charges in without hesitation. Treats fear as noise, not warning.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
