		<personalityDescription>Slavomir doesn&apos;t just dream - he plans. Every action he takes is calculated to move him forward, and he doesn&apos;t get distracted by short-term setbacks or fleeting opportunities. If he wants something, he&apos;ll get it, one way or another. Slavomir doesn&apos;t just listen - he understands. He picks up on the small things, noticing when someone needs support before they even ask, and does what he can to lighten their load, no matter how insignificant it might seem. </personalityDescription>
