		<personalityDescription>Jemarie notices the details others miss - the flicker of movement in the distance, the shift in tone during negotiations. She stays sharp, ready to act at a moment&apos;s notice, because the one time she isn&apos;t prepared might be the last. Jemarie always has a target in mind, and she won&apos;t stop until she reaches it. Every move she makes is another step toward her objective, and she doesn&apos;t waste time on anything that doesn&apos;t get her closer to success. </personalityDescription>
