		<personalityDescription>Rabdaa does what&apos;s required, nothing more, nothing less. She isn&apos;t lazy - she just sees ambition as a fool&apos;s game, one that leads to stress, betrayal, and an early grave. Rabdaa talks to people like they&apos;re always a step behind her - because in her mind, they usually are. She assumes she knows best, rarely listens to advice, and has little patience for those who can&apos;t keep up. </personalityDescription>
