		<personalityDescription>Mary doesn&apos;t leave anything to chance. She analyzes, adapts, and executes with precision, always thinking three steps ahead to ensure she controls the game rather than being a piece in it. Mary slaps control panels, kicks unresponsive consoles, and reloads her weapons with enough force to make the mechanisms groan. &quot;That&apos;s not how you&apos;re supposed to-&quot; someone starts, only to watch as Mary forces a jammed system back into working order through sheer brute insistence. </personalityDescription>
