		<personalityDescription>Massaria isn&apos;t satisfied with just getting by - they want more. Whether it&apos;s climbing the ranks, commanding their own unit, or carving their name into history, they&apos;re always pushing forward, never content to stay in one place for long. Massaria believes in their unit and makes sure they know it. Whether it&apos;s a few words of confidence before a mission or lifting someone up after a failure, they always push others to be their best. </personalityDescription>
