		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>No matter the cost, Nayen refuses to let her allies fall. She pushes herself to exhaustion, takes risks no one else will, and puts others before herself - even when it means she&apos;s the one left bleeding. Nayen doesn&apos;t just see battlefields as places of destruction - she sees art in the chaos. A burning skyline, the eerie silence before an engagement, the way smoke curls against the horizon - she notices it all. &quot;War is ugly,&quot; she says, watching the sunrise over wreckage, &quot;but sometimes, it&apos;s damn beautiful too.&quot; </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Bleeds for others, and wont stop until everyones safe.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
