		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>Indecision is just another form of weakness, and Olivia refuses to entertain it. She makes the call, moves forward, and never looks back - because in the brutal reality of war, second-guessing gets people killed. Olivia sees through people like glass. She picks apart their motives, exploits their weaknesses, and predicts their actions before they even realize what they&apos;re going to do. It&apos;s not empathy - it&apos;s just another tool for survival. </personalityDescription>
