		<personalityDescription>Cigdem doesn&apos;t just want - she takes. Whether it&apos;s battlefield salvage, a lucrative contract, or an under-the-table bribe, she ensures every advantage lands in her pocket, leaving nothing for those too slow to seize it first. Cigdem doesn&apos;t trust anything at face value. Every mission has another layer, every battle is part of some bigger scheme. &quot;You think this is just a simple engagement? Please. Someone up top is pulling the strings - we just don&apos;t know why yet.&quot; </personalityDescription>
