		<personalityDescription>Awareness is Kati&apos;s greatest weapon. They read people like a battlefield, catching the smallest shifts in expression or intent, ensuring they&apos;re never the one taken by surprise. Kati doesn&apos;t waste time on ventures that don&apos;t pay off. Every decision, every mission, every risk is calculated to ensure maximum return, and if something isn&apos;t profitable, they&apos;re already onto the next big score. </personalityDescription>
