		<personalityDescription>Caution is boring, and Thanaa would rather go down in flames than play it safe. She lives for the thrill of insane risks, treating the battlefield like a proving ground for just how crazy she can get - and somehow, she usually pulls it off. Thanaa doesn&apos;t engage in pointless fights. She picks her moments, waits for the right time, and doesn&apos;t waste energy on clashes that don&apos;t matter. &quot;Let them wear themselves out. I&apos;ll be here when it actually matters.&quot; </personalityDescription>
