		<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a quiet, unshakable certainty to Bonni, the kind that makes people listen when she speaks and follow when she leads. She doesn&apos;t need to prove herself - she already knows where she stands. Bonni sees hesitation as worse than failure. The only way to win is to take risks others won&apos;t. She thrives in desperate situations, the kind where only madmen or legends make it out alive. &quot;They think I&apos;m crazy. They just don&apos;t understand what it takes to win.&quot; </personalityDescription>
