		<personalityDescription>Francesca doesn&apos;t waste time with indecision or second-guessing - she makes the call and expects others to keep up. Francesca isn&apos;t rude, just efficient - after all, in the heat of battle, clear orders save lives. Honesty is a tool Francesca only uses when it suits her. She weaves deception effortlessly, leaving people second-guessing what&apos;s real and what&apos;s just another one of her carefully constructed falsehoods. </personalityDescription>
