		<personalityDescription>Connor doesn&apos;t just react to situations - he creates them. He manipulates events from behind the scenes, setting traps, forcing hands, and maneuvering his way to the top before anyone realizes they were playing his game all along. Connor weaves lies so seamlessly into the truth that even he might start believing them. From forged documents to fabricated histories, he&apos;s built his success on smoke and mirrors, always staying one step ahead of the truth. </personalityDescription>
