		<personalityDescription>If Danny&apos;s doing something, everyone is going to know about it. He doubles down on every decision, throws himself into everything at full speed, and refuses to settle for anything that isn&apos;t over-the-top. Danny moves with deadly precision once he&apos;s actually in the fight - but getting to that point is another story. Tripping over his own boots, misjudging doorways, and misfiring controls are just part of the package. &quot;I&apos;m great under pressure. Getting there&apos;s the problem.&quot; </personalityDescription>
