		<personalityDescription>Kelli always seems to be at the right place at the right time, making the right deals. They know when to buy, when to sell, and when to walk away with a fortune while everyone else is still figuring out what just happened. Kelli believes they&apos;re the smartest, strongest, and most important person in the room. They crave attention, thrive on admiration, and make sure everyone knows just how exceptional they are. </personalityDescription>
