		<personalityDescription>When everything goes wrong, Adaira is the one still standing, ready to fight. She charges into danger not because it&apos;s easy, but because someone has to - and if that means being the last one out, so be it. Adaira brings an infectious energy to everything she does. She&apos;s the first to charge into battle, the last to leave the bar, and somehow always has the stamina for one more round - whether it&apos;s a firefight or a drinking contest. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Last one out. Takes the risk so others don&apos;t have to. Anchor in chaos.&lt;br&gt;- Brings fire to everything. Fights hard, parties harder, never fades.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
