		<personalityDescription>Teresa has long since stopped caring about things that don&apos;t directly affect her. Wars rage, people scheme, and alliances crumble - but to her, it&apos;s all just noise. She does what&apos;s necessary and moves on without a second thought. Teresa doesn&apos;t take doubt as criticism - she takes it as a challenge. The second someone questions if she can handle a fight, she throws herself into it headfirst. &quot;Oh, you don&apos;t think I can do it? Watch me.&quot; </personalityDescription>
