		<personalityDescription>Lee thrives on audacity. He doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t second-guess, and certainly doesn&apos;t blush. Whether he&apos;s making an obscene profit, pushing boundaries, or walking away from the wreckage, he does it all with a smirk and a shrug. Lee doesn&apos;t waste words on complaints, bravado, or false hope. He fights, he endures, he survives, and that&apos;s all there is to it. &quot;Talk later. Fight now.&quot; </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Built from brass and boldness. No filter, no fear.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
