		<personalityDescription>Caution is for the slow and the dead, and Bryan refuses to be either. They rush headlong into danger, making split-second decisions that could be called bravery - or  sheer madness. One way or another, Bryan never stands still. Bryan never misses a chance to turn a profit. If there&apos;s a way to squeeze extra value out of a deal, a mission, or even a friend, they&apos;ll find it. Some call it ruthless - they calls it smart business. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 40%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects caution. Speed over safety. Bravery or recklessness - depends on the day.&lt;br&gt;- Bleeds every deal dry. Doesn&apos;t care who&apos;s on the other end.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
