		<personalityDescription>Leslie refuses to settle for mediocrity. Every step she takes is calculated, every move designed to propel her forward - because in her mind, staying still is just another form of failure. Leslie doesn&apos;t just let things go. If an enemy targets her, shoots in her direction, or even looks at her the wrong way, she&apos;s making damn sure they regret it. &quot;You scratched my armor? Bad move. Now you&apos;re my problem.&quot; </personalityDescription>
