		<personalityDescription>Cecilie plays by her own rules, which change depending on what benefits her most. She&apos;s not a villain - she just doesn&apos;t see the point in letting things like loyalty or honesty get in the way of a good deal or an easy victory. Cecilie operates on impulse, changing direction at a moment&apos;s notice. One day, she&apos;s playing it safe; the next, she&apos;s charging into a situation no sane person would touch. Keeping up with her is a challenge - predicting her is impossible. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rules bend around them - ethics don&apos;t apply.&lt;br&gt;- No warning before a hard turn. Can&apos;t rely on them to stick to plan.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
