		<personalityDescription>Alex sees every interaction as a transaction, and he always makes sure he comes out ahead. If there&apos;s a choice between helping others or helping himself, there&apos;s never really a choice at all. Most people aren&apos;t worth Alex&apos;s attention - at least, that&apos;s how he sees it. Whether it&apos;s new recruits, subordinates, or anyone beneath his notice, he brushes them aside with a look of boredom and a dismissive wave. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Every move is calculated for personal gain.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t even look back when leaving someone behind - already onto the next thing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
