		<personalityDescription>There&apos;s determination, and then there&apos;s Jane. Once she makes a decision, no amount of logic, pleading, or even superior orders will make her budge. Whether it&apos;s admirable or infuriating depends on who you ask. Jane understands that no one has all the answers - not even her. She remains open to ideas, quick to learn from mistakes, and always willing to adapt when a better path presents itself. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Logic bounces off. Orders ignored if they conflict with conviction.&lt;br&gt;- Knows when to pivot. No shame in growth.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
