		<personalityDescription>Some people seek compromise - Thomas seeks conflict. He thrives on tension, turning every conversation into a challenge and every challenge into a personal battle. If there&apos;s a peaceful solution, he&apos;s not interested. Thomas carries himself like a living legend, utterly convinced of his own greatness. Whether he deserves the reputation doesn&apos;t matter - he believes it, and that&apos;s enough for him. </personalityDescription>
