		<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a glint in Melánie&apos;s eye that never quite fades, a restless energy that crackles just beneath the surface. Whether in conversation or silence, there is an intensity to them, quiet delight in the inevitable breakdown of order. &quot;We won the battle, Melánie, lighten up.&quot; They shake their head. &quot;Sure, but now we&apos;re low on ammo, our &apos;Meks are trashed, and command&apos;s gonna send us into an even worse fight next time. We never actually win - we just survive until the next mess.&quot; The worst part? They&apos;re usually right </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Carries constant hunger. Intensity even at rest.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
