		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>Samra never doubts themself, even when they absolutely should. They struts into battle like they&apos;ve already won and dismisses any challenge with a smirk. If someone questions their skills, they&apos;ll be the first to bet their wages on proving them wrong. Samra doesn&apos;t just think highly of themself - they expect everyone else to think highly of them too. Praise is their fuel, admiration their currency, and if someone doesn&apos;t recognize their brilliance, they&apos;re clearly not worth their time. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Never doubts, even when wrong. Swagger first, strategy later.&lt;br&gt;- Team player - if the team worships them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
