		<personalityDescription>Hanne always puts themself first. Whether it&apos;s resources, recognition, or survival, they make sure they come out on top - even if it means leaving others behind. Hanne belts out a tune the moment the shooting starts. Sometimes it&apos;s a classic war ballad, sometimes it&apos;s an old drinking song, and sometimes it&apos;s just wordless humming. It&apos;s both comforting and deeply unsettling - especially when their voice stays perfectly steady even under heavy fire. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Comes first, stays first - everyone else is just background noise.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
