		<personalityDescription>Kong approaches every fight with precision, analyzing the battlefield and making calculated moves. He doesn&apos;t waste effort on flashy maneuvers - every action serves a purpose, every shot is deliberate. Kong acts like fear is something other people experience. He tells stories loudly, emphasizing every detail of how he stood firm when others might have run. Whether it&apos;s completely true or not? Well, that depends on who&apos;s asking. </personalityDescription>
