		<personalityDescription>Fear is for the weak, and Trey has no patience for hesitation. He faces overwhelming firepower with a defiant grin, daring fate to try and stop him. Whether it&apos;s reckless courage or sheer madness, only the battlefield will decide. &quot;You&apos;re bleeding,&quot; Trey says flatly. &quot;No, I&apos;m not-&quot; Before the argument can finish, he&apos;s already wrapping a bandage around the wound with practiced efficiency. He&apos;s not officially a MedTech, but his squad has learned that refusing his help is a waste of time. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats fear like weakness. Smiles at overwhelming odds. Borderline reckless.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
