		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>Amitabha believes no one else can be trusted to do things right, so they take control of everything. Every decision, every resource, every move must go through them. If their subordinates don&apos;t like it, they can be replaced. Amitabha wears the uniform, the gear, the weight of the war - but none of it ever feels real. They move like they&apos;re trapped in armor that isn&apos;t their own, unsure if the person they once was is even still underneath it all. &quot;I don&apos;t know if this body was ever mine. I just know it&apos;s the only one I&apos;ve got.&quot; </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Micromanages everything. If it moves, it&apos;s under orders - or it&apos;s gone.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
