		<personalityDescription>Angus carries a permanent chip on their shoulder, always ready to turn a disagreement into a full-blown confrontation. It doesn&apos;t matter if it&apos;s words or fists - what matters is proving they won. Angus doesn&apos;t believe in brute force when superior strategy will do. They dissect enemy formations, anticipate movements, and execute plans with ruthless efficiency - ensuring that by the time the battle begins, they&apos;ve already won. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Carries resentment like armor. Needs to win, no matter the cost.&lt;br&gt;- Strategy-first operator - kills with planning, not firepower.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
