		<personalityDescription>Alois&apos;s ambition isn&apos;t just a trait - it&apos;s a force of nature. He doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t look back, and doesn&apos;t accept limitations. If there&apos;s a path forward, he&apos;ll find it, no matter how steep the climb. Alois doesn&apos;t rely on supply chains. He&apos;s patched together weapons from three different manufacturers, repurposed enemy tech, and turned scrap into survival tools. &quot;You trust requisitions. I trust whatever I can pull off a wrecked war machine.&quot; </personalityDescription>
