		<personalityDescription>Fear died a long time ago for Taniya. She walks through hell with a steady hand, not because she doesn&apos;t understand the danger, but because she refuses to let it matter. If death comes, Taniya will meet it head-on. Once Taniya sets her sights on something, there&apos;s no stopping her. She thrives on momentum, constantly pushing herself and those around her to reach new heights. </personalityDescription>
