		<personalityDescription>Maja has a knack for making things work. Give her a scrap heap, and she&apos;ll build a functioning &apos;Mek. Give her a bad deal, and she&apos;ll flip it for a profit. She thrives in chaos, always finding ways to turn nothing into something. Maja doesn&apos;t just listen - she understands. She picks up on the small things, noticing when someone needs support before they even ask, and does what she can to lighten their load, no matter how insignificant it might seem. </personalityDescription>
