		<personalityDescription>With a quick joke and a warm smile, Matthew turns even the coldest encounters into something comfortable. He treats allies like family and strangers like potential friends, believing that a little kindness can go a long way - even in war. Matthew&apos;s flask isn&apos;t just for drinking - it&apos;s ritual. A sip before battle for luck, a sip after for survival. He swears it keeps him steady, keeps the nerves from creeping in. His squad jokes that he&apos;s pickling himself so he can live forever. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Makes friends faster than most make enemies.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
