		<personalityDescription>Zafer doesn&apos;t care about honor, mercy, or sentiment - only results. She dissects every situation with ruthless precision, seeing people as assets, obstacles, or liabilities. If a sacrifice needs to be made, she won&apos;t hesitate to pull the trigger. Most people aren&apos;t worth Zafer&apos;s attention - at least, that&apos;s how she sees it. Whether it&apos;s new recruits, subordinates, or anyone beneath her notice, she brushes them aside with a look of boredom and a dismissive wave. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Values results over sentiment. Cold strategist - sacrifices without pause.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t even look back when leaving someone behind - already onto the next thing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
