		<personalityDescription>Wars aren&apos;t just won with firepower - they&apos;re won with leverage, alliances, and well-placed words. Linda understands that diplomacy is just another battlefield, and she wield it with the same precision as a well-aimed PPC shot. Linda doesn&apos;t waste words. Every sentence is deliberate, every thought carefully considered before spoken. She sees no need to fill silences with empty chatter - if she has something to say, people will know it matters. </personalityDescription>
