		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>Iva&apos;s hunger for success, control, or destruction knows no limits. She takes and takes, pushing herself and others past the breaking point, never feeling like it&apos;s enough. Her drive isn&apos;t ambition - it&apos;s addiction. Iva doesn&apos;t waste words on complaints, bravado, or false hope. She fights, she endures, she survives, and that&apos;s all there is to it. &quot;Talk later. Fight now.&quot; </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes past limits like they don&apos;t exist. Burnout risk? Doesnt care.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
