		<personalityDescription>Nothing slows Helespôntico down - not exhaustion, not setbacks, not even failure. He grinds forward, refusing to accept defeat, because in his mind, stopping is just another way of dying. Helespôntico doesn&apos;t trust allied command, mission planners, or anyone not risking their own skin. He&apos;s seen too many decisions made by people who never have to face the consequences. &quot;Oh, great, another &apos;brilliant strategy&apos; from someone sitting in an underground, reinforced bunker.&quot; </personalityDescription>
