		<personalityDescription>Kristoffer isn&apos;t interested in quick victories - they&apos;re interested in certain victories. They wait, watch, and maneuver every piece into place before making their move, ensuring that when the moment comes, their enemies never see it coming. In a ruthless world, Kristoffer refuses to become another heartless warrior. They watch out for those who can&apos;t protect themselves, even when it costs them. The weight of every choice lingers in their mind, but they&apos;d rather carry it than let others suffer. </personalityDescription>
