		<personalityDescription>Bardhla faces the unknown with fearless determination, always pushing forward where others hesitate. Whether it&apos;s uncharted space or a battlefield stacked against her, she refuses to back down from a challenge. Bardhla knows how to get the most out of people and situations. Whether it&apos;s leveraging favors, bending the rules, or pushing people just hard enough to get results, she always makes sure she&apos;s coming out ahead. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 40%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes into the unknown. Fearless in the face of risk. Refuses retreat.&lt;br&gt;- Knows how to squeeze blood from stone - always walks away with more than they gave.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
