		<personalityDescription>Some people make friends. Alexandreina makes enemies - and seems to prefer it that way. Whether through biting sarcasm or outright aggression, she turns every interaction into a fight waiting to happen, and frankly, Alexandreina wouldn&apos;t have it any other way. Alexandreina doesn&apos;t waste time on ventures that don&apos;t pay off. Every decision, every mission, every risk is calculated to ensure maximum return, and if something isn&apos;t profitable, she&apos;s already onto the next big score. </personalityDescription>
