		<personalityDescription>Hertati refuses to quit, no matter how tough the fight gets. They keep pushing forward, adapting, enduring, and overcoming, because in their mind, the only real defeat is giving up. Hertati never misses an opportunity. They&apos;re quick to turn setbacks into advantages, shifting gears effortlessly when a better option appears. If someone hesitates, they&apos;ll already be three moves ahead, making the most of their hesitation. </personalityDescription>
