		<personalityDescription>Leonard approaches every obstacle with the unshakable certainty that he can overcome it. He thrives in high-stakes moments, his excitement infectious as he drives himself and those around him forward with almost reckless enthusiasm. Leonard claims he can&apos;t sleep. &quot;Too much to do, not enough time,&quot; he mutters, rubbing exhaustion from his eyes. Yet somehow, despite the late nights and early deployments, he never misses a mission. His squad doesn&apos;t know how he keeps going, but they&apos;re starting to think he might not, for much longer. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Charges in with full belief - infectious, but risky under fire.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
