		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>Joanne sees no reason to dance around the truth. Whether it&apos;s giving orders, delivering bad news, or calling someone out on their mistakes, they don&apos;t soften the blow - because in their mind, reality doesn&apos;t come with padding. &quot;Okay, so imagine the enemy is a pack of hungry dogs, and we&apos;re holding a steak just out of reach - no, wait, bad example, let&apos;s say they&apos;re a bunch of perfectly spherical cows - &quot; &quot;Joanne, just tell us the plan.&quot; &quot;I am!&quot; </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Truth hits hard. So do they. Doesnt apologize for either.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
