		<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
		<personalityDescription>Irene doesn&apos;t leave anything to chance. She analyzes, adapts, and executes with precision, always thinking three steps ahead to ensure she controls the game rather than being a piece in it. Everything grates on her - people, orders, even the sound of her own comms. Irene is always on edge, snapping at allies and enemies alike. Whether it&apos;s stress, trauma, or just who she is, her temper is a fuse ready to blow. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Precision thinker. Nothing left to chance, and never just a piece on the board.&lt;br&gt;- Radio chatter sets them off. So do people.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
