		<personalityDescription>Yasin knows that power isn&apos;t given - it&apos;s taken. He maneuvers people like game pieces, striking deals with one hand and slipping a dagger in with the other. If there&apos;s an opportunity to get ahead, he&apos;ll take it before anyone else even sees it coming. Yasin doesn&apos;t just hear people - he understands them. He picks up on the emotions others try to hide, offering quiet reassurances or firm guidance exactly when they need it most. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Takes power, doesn&apos;t ask for it. Strikes fast, betrays faster.&lt;br&gt;- Sees past words. Knows what people mean, not just what they say.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
