		<personalityDescription>Rules, plans, and decisions are set in stone as far as Paula is concerned. She follows them without question and expects everyone else to do the same, regardless of the circumstances. Paula doesn&apos;t wait for chances - she takes them, regardless of the cost. Allies, morals, and promises are all secondary to survival and success. If there&apos;s a gap to exploit, she&apos;ll find it, and if there isn&apos;t one, she&apos;ll make one. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 34%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rules are law. Doesn&apos;t adjust for context. Orders must be obeyed.&lt;br&gt;- Takes chances without hesitation. Morals are optional - results aren&apos;t.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
