		<personalityDescription>Punisa refuses to quit, no matter how tough the fight gets. He keeps pushing forward, adapting, enduring, and overcoming, because in his mind, the only real defeat is giving up. Punisa doesn&apos;t just dream - he plans. Every action he takes is calculated to move him forward, and he doesn&apos;t get distracted by short-term setbacks or fleeting opportunities. If he wants something, he&apos;ll get it, one way or another. </personalityDescription>
