		<personalityDescription>Netro doesn&apos;t believe in fair fights - he believes in surviving. He&apos;ll lie, cheat, betray, and destroy without hesitation, because in his world, there&apos;s no room for second place. If someone isn&apos;t strong enough to keep up, they don&apos;t deserve to be here. Netro is the guy who sighs loudly when someone asks a dumb question. He rolls his eyes, mutters under his breath, and gets annoyed over small things - but beneath the grumbling, he still gets the job done. </personalityDescription>
		<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fair fights are for fools. Ruthless, deceptive, and deadly efficient.&lt;br&gt;- No time for fools - barely any for friends.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
